scenario: batch_known_source_does_not_shadow
One batch: the first request is from a known CIDR in a new country and is silenced; the second, from elsewhere in another new country, is a thief in the same batch and is raised.

step 1  0h       app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 2  24h      app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 3  48h      app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 4  72h      app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 5  8d       one batch of 2 events
        8d       app     request  203.0.113.50 DE AS64500 openai-python/3
        8d1s     app     request  192.0.2.9 FR AS64500 openai-python/3
